# Shared secret coturn verifies TURN credentials against, and that the API signs
# them with. One secret, two consumers, one Secret in the cluster -- both the
# coturn deployment and the API mount this same one, because two copies of it
# would be a rotation bug waiting to happen.
#
# Never reaches a browser: the API hands out a username carrying its own expiry
# and an HMAC of that username, both of which lapse on their own.
TURN_SECRET=$(RAND32)
